--
-- `pg_net` is asynchronous: Cron success means the HTTP job was queued, not that
-- the consumer completed. Inspect `net._http_response` for the correlated request
-- status and sanitized response. Do not log or select request secrets.
-- The HMAC has a 90-second validity window; its authenticated empty `{}` body
-- cannot choose a cursor or batch size. Replays can cause another bounded scan,
-- so rotate the HMAC secret if exposed and monitor repeated invocation failures.
